WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:06,300
Hello do you want to buy something?

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,370
I'm not here to buy anything

3
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:10,370
I'm here to find you, Lin Yu

4
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:12,560
What are you looking for?

5
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:16,230
A month ago, I sent Yu Yu to you.

6
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:19,300
Now because of some things, I want to take her back to America

7
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,550
Sister Ya takes your emotions into consideration

8
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,550
So I give you one day to prepare

9
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,650
Sister Ya, look at it

10
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:27,640
what do you want to say

11
00:00:27,640 --> 00:00:33,070
She divorced this woman a month ago

12
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:35,170
But now that woman is looking for her again

13
00:00:35,170 --> 00:00:36,580
She met her ex-wife by herself

14
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:39,580
Go and leave Yu Yu to the people in the next store to take care of her.
